{
  "name": "29 · Generador de release notes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 29 · Release notes\n\nLlama al webhook con propietario, repo, desde_tag y hasta_tag. El flujo compara los tags en GitHub, redacta las notas con IA y crea un BORRADOR en Gmail: tú lo revisas y decides publicarlo.\n\nCredenciales: Header Auth GitHub (Authorization: Bearer), Anthropic, Gmail y Google Sheets.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_088",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wf-29-release",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_089",
      "name": "Petición de release notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const b = $json.body || {};\nconst requeridos = ['propietario', 'repo', 'desde_tag', 'hasta_tag'];\nconst faltan = requeridos.filter(function (campo) {\n  const v = b[campo];\n  return v === undefined || v === null || String(v).trim() === '';\n});\nconst salida = {\n  propietario: String(b.propietario || '').trim(),\n  repo: String(b.repo || '').trim(),\n  desde_tag: String(b.desde_tag || '').trim(),\n  hasta_tag: String(b.hasta_tag || '').trim(),\n  faltan: faltan,\n  valido: faltan.length === 0\n};\nreturn { json: salida };"
      },
      "id": "nodo_090",
      "name": "Validar petición",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_011",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valido }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_091",
      "name": "¿Petición completa?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://api.github.com/repos/' + $json.propietario + '/' + $json.repo + '/compare/' + $json.desde_tag + '...' + $json.hasta_tag }}",
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "updateAParameterInEachRequest",
              "parameters": {
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "type": "qs",
                    "name": "page",
                    "value": "={{ $pageCount + 1 }}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !Array.isArray($response.body.commits) || $response.body.commits.length < 100 }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 100,
              "requestInterval": 200
            }
          }
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "application/vnd.github+json"
            },
            {
              "name": "User-Agent",
              "value": "n8n-workflow-29"
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "per_page",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_092",
      "name": "Comparar tags en GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "GitHub (Authorization: Bearer)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const origen = $('Validar petición').first().json;\nconst pages=$input.all().map(i=>i.json);\nconst unique=new Map();\nfor(const p of pages){if(!Array.isArray(p.commits))throw new Error('Comparison page failed');for(const c of p.commits)unique.set(c.sha,c);}\nconst all=[...unique.values()];\nconst expected=pages[0]?.total_commits;\nif(!Number.isInteger(expected)||expected!==all.length||all.length>2000)throw new Error('Incomplete or oversized release comparison; split tag range');\nconst commits = all.map(function (c) {\n  const linea = c.commit && c.commit.message ? c.commit.message.split('\\n')[0] : '';\n  const autor = c.commit && c.commit.author ? c.commit.author.name : '';\n  return '- ' + linea + ' (' + autor + ')';\n}).join('\\n');\nconst sistema = [\n  'Redactas release notes claras en español para usuarios no técnicos.',\n  'Agrupa en secciones: Novedades, Mejoras, Correcciones. Omite commits internos (ci, chore, merge).',\n  'Devuelve solo el texto en Markdown, sin explicaciones extra.'\n].join('\\n');\nconst peticion_ia = {\n  model: 'claude-opus-5',\n  max_tokens: 2048,\n  system: sistema,\n  messages: [\n    { role: 'user', content: 'Repositorio: ' + origen.propietario + '/' + origen.repo + '\\nVersión: de ' + origen.desde_tag + ' a ' + origen.hasta_tag + '\\n\\nCOBERTURA: ' + all.length + ' de ' + expected + '; declara cualquier omisión.\\nCOMMITS:\\n' + commits }\n  ]\n};\nif(commits.length>120000)throw new Error(\"Release notes context too large; split tag range\");\nreturn [{ json: { total_commits: all.length, peticion_ia: peticion_ia },pairedItem:{item:0} }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_093",
      "name": "Preparar redacción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.peticion_ia) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_094",
      "name": "Redactar con Claude",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Anthropic API (x-api-key)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const bloques = $json.content || [];\nconst notas = bloques\n  .filter(function (b) { return b.type === 'text'; })\n  .map(function (b) { return b.text; })\n  .join('\\n')\n  .trim();\nconst origen = $('Validar petición').item.json;\nconst salida = {\n  repo: origen.propietario + '/' + origen.repo,\n  desde_tag: origen.desde_tag,\n  hasta_tag: origen.hasta_tag,\n  total_commits: $('Preparar redacción').item.json.total_commits,\n  notas: notas,\n  generado_en: new Date().toISOString()\n};\nreturn { json: salida };"
      },
      "id": "nodo_095",
      "name": "Extraer notas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Releases"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_096",
      "name": "Registrar generación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1540,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google Sheets (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "operation": "create",
        "subject": "=[Borrador] Release notes {{ $json.hasta_tag }} de {{ $json.repo }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Borrador generado automáticamente ({{ $json.total_commits }} commits analizados). Revísalo antes de publicar:\n\n{{ $json.notas }}",
        "options": {
          "sendTo": "REEMPLAZAR_tu_correo@ejemplo.com"
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_097",
      "name": "Borrador con las notas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Gmail (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, repo: $('Extraer notas').first().json.repo, notas: $('Extraer notas').first().json.notas } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_098",
      "name": "Responder notas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1980,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: 'faltan_campos', faltan: $json.faltan } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_099",
      "name": "Responder incompleto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
